<mjml lang="en">
  <mj-head>
    <!--
      PROBE — MSO ghost width neutralization (2026-08-21).
      Not a catalog page. Send dist/probe_ghost-width_live.html through EN to
      EoA and read outlook2021_win11_* and m365_w11_* FIRST — every other
      client is expected to render all variants identically, and a difference
      outside the Word engine is itself a finding.

      THE FINDING THIS TESTS
      MJML derives `600 - 2*gutter` from a section's authored left/right
      padding and freezes it into the Outlook-only ghost cell it wraps around
      the column group:

        <td style="...padding:16px 32px;">            <- editable, spliced
          <!--[if mso | IE]><table><tr><td style="width:536px;">   <- FROZEN

      The importer rewrites the padding value in every carrier, mso-padding-alt
      copies included, but never a width DERIVED from it. So shrinking a gutter
      is safe (the frozen box re-centres) and GROWING one is not: Word lays out
      a 536px table inside a cell that now has 64px of padding each side.

      Since 2026-08-21 the importer rewrites that number to `width:100%` at
      import, but ONLY where the ghost stands for a lone 100% column, where the
      px value carries nothing Word cannot recompute. Proportional ghosts (two
      268px halves) keep their numbers and the generator caps those frames'
      padding options instead. That rewrite is unverified in the Word engine:
      both audits that pass it run in a browser, so neither can settle it.

      VARIANTS — identical content, only the gutter and the ghost width differ.
      Each variant paints its section Moss and its content Evergreen, so the
      MOSS BAND EITHER SIDE IS THE GUTTER, directly measurable against the
      full-bleed Earth reference bar above it.

        REF  Earth bar, edge to edge. Any variant wider than this has pushed
             the email past 600px.

        Series 1 — lone 100% column (what the rewrite touches)
        A  ghost 536px · gutter 32   CONTROL, today's shipped state.
                                     Expected: 32px Moss each side.
        B  ghost 536px · gutter 64   THE DEFECT. Expected: 64px Moss in every
                                     CSS client; in Word the 536px ghost does
                                     not fit the 472px cell, so the Evergreen
                                     bar overhangs and/or the email exceeds
                                     the REF bar.
        C  ghost 100%  · gutter 32   THE FIX, no-regression case. Must be
                                     pixel-identical to A everywhere.
        D  ghost 100%  · gutter 64   THE FIX, the claim. Expected: 64px Moss
                                     each side in EVERY client, Word included.
        E  ghost 100%  · gutter 0    THE FIX at Full Bleed. Expected: no Moss
                                     band; Evergreen spans the full 600px.

        Series 2 — a two-column hero (a group inside a section)
        F  outer ghost 100% · inner 268px · gutter 32
             The authored state after the rewrite. Must match H exactly.
        G  outer ghost 100% · inner 268px · gutter 48
             The case the importer's cap now REFUSES to offer. The inner 268px
             halves are frozen and 268+268 = 536 does not fit a 504px cell.
             Expected to break in Word; that break is why the cap exists.
        H  real MJML two-column section · gutter 32
             Untouched control, compiled normally by this build.

      VERDICT RULE
      Adopt the rewrite only if C is identical to A AND D holds its 64px
      gutter in the Word engine. If D shows the same overhang as B, the ghost
      width is load-bearing in Word and the rewrite must be reverted in favour
      of capping every frame (src/core/ghostWidths.ts, and the "Unsafe growth"
      section of CONVENTIONS.md).

      If B renders correctly, the diagnosis is wrong: Word is not honouring
      that ghost width at all, nothing needs neutralizing, and the cap alone
      is the whole fix.

      G is diagnostic, not a gate. It should fail; if it does not, the cap is
      stricter than Word requires and the proportional case can be revisited.
    -->
    <mj-breakpoint width="600px" />
    <mj-title>PROBE — MSO ghost width neutralization</mj-title>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Tahoma, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="14px" line-height="20px" color="#362229" padding="0" />
      <mj-section padding="0" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      .bar { font-size:14px; font-weight:700; line-height:20px; text-align:center;
             color:#F5FAF1; background-color:#006837; padding:10px 0; }
      .halfbar { font-size:12px; font-weight:700; line-height:16px; text-align:center;
                 color:#F5FAF1; background-color:#362229; padding:10px 0; }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#FAFAFA">

    <!-- Real MJML section: also what makes MJML emit the .mj-column-per-100
         and .mj-column-per-50 rules the raw variants below rely on. -->
    <mj-section background-color="#F5FAF1" padding="16px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          <strong>PROBE — MSO ghost width</strong><br />
          The Moss band either side of each Evergreen bar is that variant's
          gutter. Compare every bar against the Earth reference bar below.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- REF: full-bleed 600px reference bar -->
    <mj-section background-color="#362229" padding="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#F5FAF1" align="center" padding="8px 0">
          <strong>REF — 600px, edge to edge</strong>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- ===================================================================
         SERIES 1 — lone 100% column. Only the gutter and the ghost width
         differ between A-E; everything else is byte-identical.
         =================================================================== -->

    <mj-raw>
      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" bgcolor="#CEE4C5" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]-->
      <div style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;">
        <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;width:100%;">
          <tbody><tr>
            <td style="direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:16px 32px;text-align:center;">
              <!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:536px;" ><![endif]-->
              <div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align:top;" width="100%">
                  <tbody><tr><td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;">
                    <div class="bar">A &nbsp;ghost 536px &nbsp;·&nbsp; gutter 32 &nbsp;·&nbsp; CONTROL</div>
                  </td></tr></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
            </td>
          </tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->

      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" bgcolor="#CEE4C5" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]-->
      <div style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;">
        <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;width:100%;">
          <tbody><tr>
            <td style="direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:16px 64px;text-align:center;">
              <!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:536px;" ><![endif]-->
              <div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align:top;" width="100%">
                  <tbody><tr><td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;">
                    <div class="bar">B &nbsp;ghost 536px &nbsp;·&nbsp; gutter 64 &nbsp;·&nbsp; THE DEFECT</div>
                  </td></tr></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
            </td>
          </tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->

      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" bgcolor="#CEE4C5" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]-->
      <div style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;">
        <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;width:100%;">
          <tbody><tr>
            <td style="direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:16px 32px;text-align:center;">
              <!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;" ><![endif]-->
              <div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align:top;" width="100%">
                  <tbody><tr><td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;">
                    <div class="bar">C &nbsp;ghost 100% &nbsp;·&nbsp; gutter 32 &nbsp;·&nbsp; must equal A</div>
                  </td></tr></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
            </td>
          </tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->

      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" bgcolor="#CEE4C5" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]-->
      <div style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;">
        <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;width:100%;">
          <tbody><tr>
            <td style="direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:16px 64px;text-align:center;">
              <!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;" ><![endif]-->
              <div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align:top;" width="100%">
                  <tbody><tr><td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;">
                    <div class="bar">D &nbsp;ghost 100% &nbsp;·&nbsp; gutter 64 &nbsp;·&nbsp; THE CLAIM</div>
                  </td></tr></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
            </td>
          </tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->

      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" bgcolor="#CEE4C5" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]-->
      <div style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;">
        <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;width:100%;">
          <tbody><tr>
            <td style="direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:16px 0;text-align:center;">
              <!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;" ><![endif]-->
              <div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align:top;" width="100%">
                  <tbody><tr><td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;">
                    <div class="bar">E &nbsp;ghost 100% &nbsp;·&nbsp; gutter 0 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Full Bleed</div>
                  </td></tr></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
            </td>
          </tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
    </mj-raw>

    <!-- ===================================================================
         SERIES 2 — a two-column hero: an mj-group inside a section. The
         OUTER ghost is the lone 100% group wrapper (rewritten); the INNER
         268px halves are proportional and are NOT.
         =================================================================== -->

    <mj-raw>
      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" bgcolor="#CEE4C5" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]-->
      <div style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;">
        <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;width:100%;">
          <tbody><tr>
            <td style="direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:16px 32px;text-align:center;">
              <!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;" ><![endif]-->
              <div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0;line-height:0;text-align:left;display:inline-block;width:100%;direction:ltr;">
                <!--[if mso | IE]><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" ><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:268px;" ><![endif]-->
                <div class="mj-column-per-50 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:50%;">
                  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tbody><tr>
                    <td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;">
                      <div class="halfbar">F &nbsp;left half</div>
                    </td>
                  </tr></tbody></table>
                </div>
                <!--[if mso | IE]></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:268px;" ><![endif]-->
                <div class="mj-column-per-50 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:50%;">
                  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tbody><tr>
                    <td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;">
                      <div class="halfbar">F &nbsp;right half &nbsp;·&nbsp; gutter 32 &nbsp;·&nbsp; must equal H</div>
                    </td>
                  </tr></tbody></table>
                </div>
                <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
              </div>
              <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
            </td>
          </tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->

      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:600px;" width="600" bgcolor="#CEE4C5" ><tr><td style="line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;"><![endif]-->
      <div style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;">
        <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#CEE4C5;background-color:#CEE4C5;width:100%;">
          <tbody><tr>
            <td style="direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:16px 48px;text-align:center;">
              <!--[if mso | IE]><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="" style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;" ><![endif]-->
              <div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0;line-height:0;text-align:left;display:inline-block;width:100%;direction:ltr;">
                <!--[if mso | IE]><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" ><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:268px;" ><![endif]-->
                <div class="mj-column-per-50 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:50%;">
                  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tbody><tr>
                    <td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;">
                      <div class="halfbar">G &nbsp;left half</div>
                    </td>
                  </tr></tbody></table>
                </div>
                <!--[if mso | IE]></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:268px;" ><![endif]-->
                <div class="mj-column-per-50 mj-outlook-group-fix" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:50%;">
                  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tbody><tr>
                    <td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;">
                      <div class="halfbar">G &nbsp;right half &nbsp;·&nbsp; gutter 48 &nbsp;·&nbsp; SHOULD BREAK</div>
                    </td>
                  </tr></tbody></table>
                </div>
                <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
              </div>
              <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
            </td>
          </tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
    </mj-raw>

    <!-- H — real MJML two-column section, compiled by this build. The
         untouched control: F must match it exactly. -->
    <mj-section background-color="#CEE4C5" padding="16px 32px">
      <mj-group>
        <mj-column width="50%">
          <mj-text align="center" color="#F5FAF1" container-background-color="#362229" padding="10px 0">
            <strong>H&nbsp; left half</strong>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="50%">
          <mj-text align="center" color="#F5FAF1" container-background-color="#362229" padding="10px 0">
            <strong>H&nbsp; right half · real MJML · gutter 32</strong>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-group>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#F5FAF1" padding="16px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          Read Outlook first. A and C must be identical; C and D are the fix;
          B should overhang. F must equal H. G is expected to break — that
          break is why the importer caps proportional frames.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
